  "description": {
   "en": "Rin Ishikawa, 19 years old, is a professional boxer competing in his first world title match. A man who has no doubts about his own talent.\n\nWhat's more, he is a man who has even been given a talent from heaven.\n\n\n“Genius” is something fierce and ephemeral.\n\"Talent\" is something that can be destroyed in an instant even after years of training.\n\"Pugilism'' means eating each other's flesh."
